520
00:20:33,107 --> 00:20:35,442
Oh, my God.

521
00:20:35,484 --> 00:20:37,987
Joey.

522
00:20:40,907 --> 00:20:42,366
Oh, my God!

523
00:20:48,288 --> 00:20:50,041
